WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.046
Welcome to Module 7 of the
Non-Person Identity learning path:

2
00:00:04.046 --> 00:00:07.162
convert to managed
identities and federation.

3
00:00:07.162 --> 00:00:09.720
This module is the first half of Gate 5,

4
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:13.350
Conversion, with Chapter 5
of the developer workbook.

5
00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.625
It's where service accounts and
secrets actually get replaced.

6
00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:19.344
You'll plan conversions
in the program's order:

7
00:00:19.344 --> 00:00:23.636
a managed identity for an Azure-hosted
workload, a federated credential

8
00:00:23.636 --> 00:00:28.000
where the host has an issuer, and a
certificate only where neither applies.

9
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.658
You'll check each federated credential
against the claims the workload will present,

10
00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:35.938
and test it against a fake token
endpoint before it's created.

11
00:00:35.938 --> 00:00:38.776
Then you'll read each
conversion's parallel run,

12
00:00:38.776 --> 00:00:41.613
and see when the legacy
account may be disabled.

13
00:00:41.613 --> 00:00:47.180
The code is illustrative: tested against
fixtures, not run against a live tenant.
